{"html": "<div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要7＋準主要7指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">RSI(14)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:30.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:49.5%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">50</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ボリンジャー</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:83.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:44.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-0.3σ</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">25日線乖離</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:25.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:25.0%; width:30.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:55.0%; width:20.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:75.0%; width:25.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:73.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">-0.7%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MACD</span><div class=\"mtrack\"